    "skillId": "skill-problem-solving",
    "type": "aptitude",
    "questionType": "mcq",
    "prompt": "A batsman has a certain average of runs for 11 innings. In the 12th inning, he makes a score of 90 runs and thereby increases his average by 5 runs. What is his new average?",
